<para id="para-00146">Stephens, R. L., Langworthy, B. W., Short, S. J., Girault, J. B., Styner, M. A., &amp; Gilmore, J. H. (2020). White matter development from birth to 6 years of age: A longitudinal study. <emphasis effect="italics">Cerebral Cortex</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">30</emphasis>(12), 6152–6168. https://doi.org/10.1093/cercor/bhaa170</para>
