<para id="para-00148">United Nations Children’s Fund, &amp; World Health Organization. (2018). <emphasis effect="italics">Breastfeeding: A mother's gift, for every child</emphasis> [White paper]. United Nations Children’s Fund (UNICEF). https://coilink.org/20.500.12592/pzgmtsj</para>
